.TH PENDINGOP 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
PendingOp \- One queued scene\-stack change, stored in Engine.pending until the current callback returns
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqengine.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct PendingOp { SceneOp op; Scene *scene; } PendingOp;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
One queued scene\-stack change, stored in Engine.pending until the current callback returns. Internal; documented so the Engine struct reads clearly.
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B op
what to do
.TP
.B scene
the scene to push (NULL for a pop)
.SH MODULE
core (src/engine/core/engine.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SceneOp (3),
.BR Engine (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
